    "details": "<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"dcbcd9a6-84d1-4bdb-b1eb-970fb842d919\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\">\n<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"gs55mz\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"22\">Build for Bharat 2.0</h1>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"myjbsz\" data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"82\">The Flagship 36-Hour Hackathon at Chandigarh University</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"401\"><strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"108\">Build for Bharat 2.0</strong> is a flagship national-level hackathon organized at <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"186\">Chandigarh University</strong>, bringing together students, developers, innovators, designers, entrepreneurs, and technology enthusiasts from across the country to identify real-world challenges and build meaningful, technology-driven solutions.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"582\">The hackathon is designed to move beyond ideas and encourage participants to transform problems into <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"564\">innovative, practical, scalable, and impactful solutions</strong> using technology.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"q3ms6n\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"607\">Prize Pool &amp; Rewards</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"644\"><strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"644\">Total Rewards: ₹20.50 Lakhs+</strong></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"fnj4hg\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"678\">SAS Vouchers Worth ₹20 Lakhs</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"830\">Participants will have the opportunity to compete for <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"766\">SAS vouchers worth ₹20,00,000</strong>, providing access to SAS products, technologies, and resources.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"jsiywe\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"861\">Cash Prizes Worth ₹50,000</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"955\">In addition to the SAS vouchers, <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"921\">₹50,000 in cash prizes</strong> will be awarded to winning teams.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"987\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"987\">Total Rewards: ₹20,50,000+</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"13m8hqz\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1013\">Hackathon Format</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"16nk9k\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1066\">Round 1 &mdash; Online Registration &amp; Idea Submission</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1190\">Participants will register their teams through <strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1125\">Unstop</strong> and submit their proposed solution in the prescribed PPT format.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1230\">Teams are expected to clearly present:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1439\">\n<li data-section-id=\"6ds52r\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1257\">Problem being addressed</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aw1elv\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1289\">Target users and stakeholders</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8c1l8x\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1309\">Proposed solution</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"toqo3a\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1337\">Innovation and uniqueness</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1aorcls\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1368\">Data sources and methodology</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xql4ml\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1389\">Technical approach</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"az89db\" data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1409\">Expected outcomes</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"82xihb\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1439\">Potential real-world impact</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1502\"><strong data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1502\">Registration &amp; PPT Submission Deadline: 25 September 2026</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1664\">The submitted proposals will be evaluated based on the quality of the problem, innovation, feasibility, approach, potential impact, and overall solution vision.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"lb663m\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1707\">Round 2 &mdash; 36-Hour On-Campus Hackathon</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1829\">Shortlisted teams from Round 1 will be invited to <strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1784\">Chandigarh University</strong> for the final <strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1828\">36-hour offline hackathon</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1950\"><strong data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1841\">Dates:</strong> 7&ndash;8 October 2026<br data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1861\" /><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1874\">Duration:</strong> 36 Hours<br data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\" /><strong data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1895\">Mode:</strong> Offline / On-Campus<br data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1918\" /><strong data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1928\">Venue:</strong> Chandigarh University</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2111\">During the final round, teams will transform their proposed ideas into functional prototypes through intensive development, testing, validation, and iteration.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2116\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1emrvfi\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2141\">Participant Benefits</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2205\">Participants attending the on-campus final round will receive:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2623\">\n<li data-section-id=\"bsx39m\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2241\"><strong data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2241\">3 meals during the hackathon</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12qt0pd\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2277\"><strong data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2277\">Lunch and Dinner on 7 October</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mv2zrg\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2306\"><strong data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2306\">Breakfast on 8 October</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ig4frc\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2377\">Opportunity to participate in a <strong data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2377\">36-hour national-level hackathon</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pfejoz\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2441\">Opportunity to compete for <strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2441\">₹20.50 Lakhs+ in total rewards</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"693nws\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2505\">Opportunity to showcase solutions to mentors and jury members</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4dx8yu\" data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2558\">Hands-on experience in solving real-world problems</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1eec985\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2623\">Networking opportunities with fellow innovators and developers</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2628\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"yqs2nu\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2650\">Participation Fee</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2669\"><strong data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2669\">₹400 per team</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2812\">Shortlisted teams proceeding to the final on-campus round will participate at Chandigarh University as per the event's participation process.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2817\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"wetxa0\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2840\">Problem Statements</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2933\">The <strong data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2932\">Problem Statements for Build for Bharat 2.0 are available on the Unstop event page</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3040\">Participants can <strong data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3039\">scroll down on the event page to access and download the Problem Statement document</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3224\">Teams are encouraged to study their selected problem carefully, understand the real-world context, identify relevant stakeholders, and develop a solution with clear practical impact.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3229\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"15t860x\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3250\">What We Look For</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3306\">Build for Bharat 2.0 seeks solutions that demonstrate:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3576\">\n<li data-section-id=\"9wa77o\" data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3345\">Strong understanding of the problem</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jk00hf\" data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3374\">Innovation and originality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6ezc42\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3413\">Effective use of technology and data</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gcmpog\" data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3437\">Technical feasibility</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"to71dq\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3463\">Practical applicability</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yc90gn\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3477\">Scalability</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14y9b7u\" data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3503\">Clear stakeholder value</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"k4amko\" data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3534\">Measurable real-world impact</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6hfzld\" data-start=\"3535\" data-end=\"3576\">A functional and demonstrable prototype</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3700\">The choice of technology and methodology is open to participants and should be appropriate to the problem being addressed.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3705\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"186gzjm\" data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3730\">Who Can Participate?</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3929\">The hackathon is open to students, developers, designers, researchers, innovators, entrepreneurs, and technology enthusiasts who are passionate about solving real-world problems through technology.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"4013\">Participants are encouraged to form multidisciplinary teams with expertise across:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4223\"><strong data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4223\">Artificial Intelligence | Machine Learning | Data Science | Software Development | Web &amp; App Development | Cybersecurity | Cloud Computing | UI/UX | Data Analytics | Product Development | Entrepreneurship</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4228\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"99n810\" data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4248\">Important Dates</h2>\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\" dir=\"auto\">\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4746\">\n<thead data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4266\">\n<tr data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4266\">\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4250\" data-end=\"4258\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Event</th>\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Date</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4746\">\n<tr data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4334\">\n<td data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4309\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Registration &amp; PPT Submission</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4334\"><strong data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4332\">25 September 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4387\">\n<td data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4363\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final On-Campus Hackathon</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4387\"><strong data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4385\">7&ndash;8 October 2026</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4427\">\n<td data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4411\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Round Duration</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4427\"><strong data-start=\"4413\" data-end=\"4425\">36 Hours</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4462\">\n<td data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Final Round Mode</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4462\"><strong data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4460\">Offline</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4500\">\n<td data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4471\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Venue</td>\n<td data-start=\"4471\" data-end=\"4500\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4498\">Chandigarh University</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4542\">\n<td data-start=\"4501\" data-end=\"4521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Participation Fee</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4542\"><strong data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4540\">₹400 per team</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4575\">\n<td data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4560\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meals Provided</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4575\"><strong data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4573\">3 Meals</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4610\">\n<td data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4588\" data-col-size=\"sm\">7 October</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4610\"><strong data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4608\">Lunch &amp; Dinner</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4640\">\n<td data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">8 October</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4640\"><strong data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4638\">Breakfast</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4680\">\n<td data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SAS Vouchers</td>\n<td data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4680\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4678\">Worth ₹20,00,000</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4710\">\n<td data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cash Prizes</td>\n<td data-start=\"4695\" data-end=\"4710\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4697\" data-end=\"4708\">₹50,000</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4746\">\n<td data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Total Rewards</td>\n<td data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4746\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4744\">₹20,50,000+</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"cexp1f\" data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4770\">From Idea to Impact</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4954\">A great idea is only the beginning. The real challenge is to understand the problem, build the right solution, validate it, and demonstrate its potential to create meaningful impact.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"5091\"><strong data-start=\"4956\" data-end=\"4980\">Build for Bharat 2.0</strong> provides the platform to turn ideas into solutions, compete at a national level, and showcase your innovation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5186\"><strong data-start=\"5093\" data-end=\"5186\">Bring your team.<br data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5114\" />Bring your ideas.<br data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5134\" />Bring your skills.<br data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5155\" />Build something that matters.</strong></p>\n<h1 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"gs55mz\" data-start=\"5188\" data-end=\"5210\">Build for Bharat 2.0</h1>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"2rr2f\" data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5281\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">36 Hours. Real Problems. Real Solutions. ₹20.50 Lakhs+ in Rewards.</h3>\n</div>",
